==== sched
strata$ sched
time slice: # us; # switches/s, # KiB/s moved by switches
==== sched 3ms
strata$ sched #ms
==== sched 2000
strata$ sched #
==== sched 1x
strata$ sched #x
usage: sched [N | Nus | Nms] (#us .. #ms)
[exit #]
==== sched 1s
strata$ sched #s
usage: sched [N | Nus | Nms] (#us .. #ms)
[exit #]
==== units
strata$ units
units: # functions of # KiB, chains # calls deep
paged sum = #
resident sum= #
check: ok
[# code units paged in]
